# Most of this directory is home-manager output: symlinks into /nix/store/
# whose paths change on every rebuild. The source of truth lives in nix-darwin/.
# devenv/ contains real hand-maintained files for the project devshell.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.mcp.json

# Source of truth for the home-manager / nix-darwin build
!nix-darwin/
!nix-darwin/**

# Hand-maintained devenv project source
!devenv/
!devenv/**
# ...minus home-manager symlinks and devenv runtime state inside it
devenv/.claude/settings.json
devenv/.mcp.json
devenv/.devenv/
devenv/.direnv/
devenv/.devenv.flake.nix
devenv/sites/*.caddy
!devenv/sites/example.caddy
devenv/.DS_Store

/.worktrees
